            <h2 class="pipe">Reliable Paving & Site Work Across Concord</h2>
            <p>S. Phaneuf & Associates executes commercial parking lot milling, foundation excavation, and bluestone patio construction throughout Concord. In <strong>Concord Center</strong>, crews handle high-end masonry walkways, asphalt resurfacing, and cobblestone apron installations near historic landmarks including the Old North Bridge, Minute Man National Historical Park, and The Old Manse. In <strong>West Concord</strong>, teams execute heavy site clearing, utility trenching, and commercial asphalt paving near the West Concord MBTA Station and along Nashoba Brook. S. Phaneuf & Associates delivers historical architectural compliance combined with modern heavy civil construction standards across Concord.</p>
